          "id": "resp-28",
          "statement": "**Scan** a codebase's manifests and source to mint an initial system, container, and component structure.",
          "lastTouchedAt": 1784883634
        },
        {
          "id": "resp-29",
          "statement": "**Resolve** declared imports across supported languages to audit links against real dependencies.",
          "lastTouchedAt": 1784883634
